If the pdf versions of the graded readers do not allow you to download them, you can find the graded reader texts at this google drive link: https://drive.google.com/drive/folders/1pUrtUdh7PDFaL0Q1eF5j4PdsY2JSHLi1

The graded readers used in this study were (1) La quinceñera (in Spanish 2) and (2) Quarter Abroad en Argentina (Spanish 3). The writing task asked students to summarize the plot of the graded reader that they had read. The prompt was as follows:
"Please write a summary of the plot of the book in Spanish. Write a minimum of 150 words and a maximum of 300 words."

